    slug: 'disclaimer', title: 'Independent Website Disclaimer | ShreeWinAPK.net', description: 'Read the independent-site, external-link, information-accuracy and gaming-risk disclaimer for ShreeWinAPK.net.', eyebrow: 'Important website disclosure', h1: 'Independent Website Disclaimer', intro: 'ShreeWinAPK.net is an independent information website. It does not claim to own, operate or officially represent the ShreeWin platform.',
